{"surah":79,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَّٰ</span>زِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>تِ غَرْقًا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَّٰ</span>شِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">طَٰ</span>تِ نَشْطًا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَّٰ</span>بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>تِ سَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>حًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَّٰ</span>بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">قَٰ</span>تِ سَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>قًا","فَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُدَبِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">رَٰ</span>تِ أَمْرًا","يَوْمَ تَرْجُفُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّاجِفَةُ","تَتْبَعُهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّادِفَةُ","قُلُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">بٌ يَ</span>وْمَئِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ذٍ وَ</span>اجِفَةٌ","أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">صَٰ</span>رُهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">خَٰ</span>شِعَةٌ","يَقُولُونَ أَءِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ا لَمَرْدُودُونَ فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَافِرَةِ","أَءِذَا كُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ا عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ظَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مًا نَّ</span>خِرَةً","قَالُو<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> تِلْكَ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ذًا كَ</span>رَّةٌ خَاسِرَةٌ","فَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>مَا هِىَ زَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ةٌ </span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وَٰ</span>حِدَةٌ","فَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa_shafawi\">هُم بِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّاهِرَةِ","هَلْ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span>كَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ","إِذْ نَادَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هُ رَبُّهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْوَادِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى","ٱذْهَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span> إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> طَغَىٰ","فَقُلْ هَل لَّكَ إِلَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن تَ</span>زَكَّىٰ","وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ","فَأَرَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَيَةَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>رَىٰ","فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ","ثُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دْ</span>بَرَ يَسْعَىٰ","فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ","فَقَالَ أَنَا۟ رَبُّكُمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَعْلَىٰ","فَأَخَذَهُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهُ نَكَالَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَخِرَةِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُولَىٰٓ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> فِى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ لَعِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>رَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">ةً لِّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مَن يَ</span>خْشَىٰٓ","ءَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتُ</span>مْ أَشَدُّ خَلْقًا أَمِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءُ‌ۚ بَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">نَٰ</span>هَا","رَفَعَ سَمْكَهَا فَسَوَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هَا","وَأَغْطَشَ لَيْلَهَا وَأَخْرَجَ ضُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ذَٰ</span>لِكَ دَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>هَآ","أَخْرَجَ مِنْهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span>ءَهَا وَمَرْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>هَا","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجِبَالَ أَرْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>هَا","مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">تَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_wo_ghunnah\">عًا لَّ</span>كُمْ وَلِأَنْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>مِكُمْ","فَإِذَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">جَآ</span>ءَتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_necessary\">طَّآ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ةُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>رَىٰ","يَوْمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>نُ مَا سَعَىٰ","وَبُرِّزَتِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَحِيمُ لِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مَن يَ</span>رَىٰ","فَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن طَ</span>غَىٰ","وَءَاثَرَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَيَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">وٰ</span>ةَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>دُّنْيَا","فَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَحِيمَ هِىَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَأْوَىٰ","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَنْ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> وَنَهَى <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>فْسَ عَنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْهَوَىٰ","فَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْجَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>ةَ هِىَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمَأْوَىٰ","يَسْــَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">سَٰ</span>هَا","فِيمَ أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span> مِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن ذِ</span>كْرَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ٮٰ</span>هَآ","إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>هَآ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span> مُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نذِ</span>رُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مَن يَ</span>خْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">شَٰ</span>هَا","كَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ثُوٓ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-slnt\">اْ</span> إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">حَٰ</span>هَا"]}